{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dual-Wield Destruction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual-wield devastating weapon combos and surge with momentum in a Roguelite FPS where speed multiplies your damage, every upgrade stacks, and time itself becomes your weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Momentum-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed multiplies your damage. Chain grapples, slides, wallruns, and railgrinds to build momentum, then unleash firepower for furious damage. Dodge a constant barrage of enemy projectiles with deft movement and timed parries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/bc3a3467e3909c579da1ffeafe9b1673.poster.avif?t=1768560127\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/bc3a3467e3909c579da1ffeafe9b1673.webm?t=1768560127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/bc3a3467e3909c579da1ffeafe9b1673.mp4?t=1768560127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reaper Mode Execution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rack up kills to activate Reaper Mode \u2014 pause time, wreak havoc, then unpause reality to shatter clusters of foes in a single moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft Overpowered Builds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slot attachments into weapons on a hex grid where placement matters. Turn shotguns into flamethrowers or bananas into nukes.\u00a0Rearrange anytime to maximize elemental effects, discover wild synergies, and completely change how you fight mid-run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/5ee8ab76c57038c4f9b346e0a9cfecde.poster.avif?t=1768560127\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/5ee8ab76c57038c4f9b346e0a9cfecde.webm?t=1768560127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/5ee8ab76c57038c4f9b346e0a9cfecde.mp4?t=1768560127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Die with Purpose</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a new configuration of chaos \u2014 new weapon combos, new enemy encounters, and new ways to break the game. Every death builds upon the last, earning permanent upgrades at the end of each run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rewrite a Broken Future</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the architects of endless brutality in a blood-curdling odyssey through underwater prisons, cyberpunk cityscapes, and into the great beyond to settle the score. Save your sister and save Earth from the evil CEO who made you into a killing machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/1817006947315f7bbd2b23c08ebbfbaf.poster.avif?t=1768560127\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/1817006947315f7bbd2b23c08ebbfbaf.webm?t=1768560127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/1817006947315f7bbd2b23c08ebbfbaf.mp4?t=1768560127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Wishlist Gunstoppable for the launch notification!</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724710?t=1768560127